OL,3,GNEWSAPolice warning over scam calls
OL,4,Aposing as officers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA scam warning has been issued by
OL,7,FDerbyshire Police after a number of
OL,8,Fresidents received phone calls from
OL,9,Ffraudsters pretending to be officers.
OL,11,FPolice said calls had been made on
OL,12,FMonday afternoon using a "number
OL,13,Fspoofing" technique where the number
OL,14,Fbeing displayed is changed.
OL,16,FThe calls - which showed to residents
OL,17,Fas coming from a number starting 01773
OL,18,Fand ending in 215 - claimed to be from
OL,19,Fpolice officers to attempt to gain
OL,20,Fpersonal details including financial
OL,21,Finformation by saying details had been
OL,22,Frecovered during an investigation.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
