OL,3,GNEWSAPolice warning over scam calls
OL,4,Aposing as officers
OL,5,
OL,6,FSo many scam calls were being made that
OL,7,Fthe force asked people to report online
OL,8,Fas the numbers were "causing unusually
OL,9,Fhigh wait times" on its own phone
OL,10,Flines.
